1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,400
菲尔 非常感谢你来帮忙
Phil, thank you so much for helping,

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,960
尤其是在昨天晚上杰对你那么无礼后
especially after Jay was so rude to you last night.

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:09,180
我想开始一项新的家庭传统
I wanted to start a new family tradition.

4
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,900
某种程度上来说 我成功了
In a way, I succeeded --

5
00:00:11,184 --> 00:00:14,140
现在我们有了不喜欢菲尔日
we now have Phil Un-appreciation Day.

6
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,980
请听啊 请听啊
Hear ye, hear ye!

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,480
别这样
Nope.

8
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,780
我宣布首届
I hereby declare the opening

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,420
年度邓菲运动会开始
of the first annual Dunphy Games.

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,380
坚决不要
Hard pass.

11
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,500
力量的考验 运气的测试
Tests of strength, games of chance --

12
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:28,261
冠军将获得大家梦寐以求的邓菲圣杯
with the champion receiving the coveted Dunphy chalice

13
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:30,920
和这张酸奶乐园的礼品券
and this gift card to Yogurtland.

14
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,840
菲尔 没人要玩啦
Phil, it's not going to happen.

15
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:35,340
你的反对我已经听到了 大长老
Your dissent has been noted, town elder,

16
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,220
但也许应该让年轻的人们
but perhaps those who've seen fewer winters

17
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,320
来投一票
should cast a vote.

18
00:00:41,768 --> 00:00:44,980
谁敢接受面条比武的挑战
Who dares accept the challenge of a noodle-joust?

19
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:45,840
没人买账 老爸
No sale, Dad.

20
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,240
好吧 你尽力了 儿子
Oh, well. Nice try, Son.

21
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:51,160
我还是开车原路返回佛罗里达吧
I'll probably just drive back to Florida, then.

22
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,520
很高兴见到各位
Great to see you guys.

23
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:07,120
我就是觉得每个人都长大了
I just thought with everyone growing up,

24
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:08,980
一项新传统也许能给我们一个
a new tradition might give us another excuse

25
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,460
每年聚一次的理由
to get together every year.

26
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,639
亲爱的 我们今天就可以聚在一起
Oh, baby, we can get together today

27
00:01:12,639 --> 00:01:14,940
去参加乔的足球队派对啊
for Joe's soccer-team party.

28
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:16,459
有超级英雄要来
We have superheroes coming.

29
00:01:16,459 --> 00:01:19,106
有超人 X战警
We have the Superman, the X-Men.

30
00:01:19,106 --> 00:01:21,863
杰就这么叫我和我爸 傻X战警[前男人]
That's what Jay called my dad and me. Ex-men.

31
00:01:21,863 --> 00:01:23,417
好疼
Ohh! That hurts!

32
00:01:23,417 --> 00:01:24,600
-怎么了 怎么回事 -没事
- Why, what happened? - ?Oh, it's nothing.

33
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,900
可能是我踩高跷伤的屁股又犯了
It's probably just my stilter's hip flaring up.

34
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,620
不 好像不是
No, it's not.

35
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,000
你看起来不太好啊
Oh, you don't look that good.

36
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:29,960
你发烧了吗
Do you have a fever?

37
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,840
不知道 我感觉不出来
I don't know. I can't tell.

38
00:01:33,508 --> 00:01:35,468
糟糕 你在烧呢
Ay, no, you're burning up!

39
00:01:35,478 --> 00:01:38,480
您好 我订了你们的超软胶底袜子
Hi, I ordered your Ultra-Soft Gel-Heel Socks,

40
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:40,300
两只袜子都标着"L"
and they are both marked "L."

41
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,960
"L"是指左...[left]
And "L" is for --

42
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,480
'L'指的是大[large]啊 好好笑
"L" is for large. Hilarious.

43
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,140
我以为我穿着两只左脚的袜子呢
I'm thinking I've been wearing two left socks.

44
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:47,818
我好可爱
I am adorable.

45
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,220
能稍等我一下吗
Can you hang on a second?

46
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,580
-你好 -克莱尔 一切都好
- Hello? - Claire, everything is okay,

47
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:54,140
但我现在在带菲尔去医院
but I am taking Phil to the hospital.

48
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,200
他死了
He's dead!

49
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:58,580
我只是在闭目养神啦
I was just resting my eyes!

50
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,580
-天啊 怎么了 -没事的 亲爱的
- Oh, God! What happened?! - It's okay, honey.

51
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,320
我就是有点胃疼
I just have a little bit of stomach pain.

52
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,146
坚持住 亲爱的 我我我 我这就过去
Hang in there, sweetie. I'll -- I'm -- I'm -- I'm coming.

53
00:02:04,146 --> 00:02:05,693
我 我马上 我马上过去
I'll be -- I'll be -- I'll be there.

54
00:02:06,946 --> 00:02:07,980
你不是吧 兄弟
Really, Schwartzy?

55
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:09,077
我要推杆的时候给我打电话
Calling me while I'm putting?

56
00:02:09,077 --> 00:02:11,980
就是这种下三滥的手段 你老婆才会抛弃你
It's bush-league moves like that why your wife left you,

57
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:14,680
我们才会打扑克却从不邀请你 我们才...
why we still play poker and never invite you, why we --

58
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,140
是歌洛莉亚
Oh, it's Gloria.

59
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,620
杰 去接乔 然后到医院找我
Jay, pick up Joe and meet me at the hospital!

60
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:20,100
怎么了 是斯黛拉出事了吗
What happened? Is it Stella?!

61
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:21,776
不是 是菲尔
No, it's Phil!

62
00:02:21,776 --> 00:02:23,500
等下 我接另一个电话
Wait a minute, I'm -- I'm getting another call.

63
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,600
-老爸 -我听说了
- Dad-- ?- I heard.

64
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,920
好了 海莉和卢克在你那个俱乐部上班
Okay, Haley and Luke are working at the club.

65
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,640
你能带上他俩 然后到医院找我吗
Can you grab them and meet me at the hospital?

66
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,339
当然 抱歉 各位
Sure thing. Sorry, guys.

67
00:02:30,339 --> 00:02:31,740
情况紧急 我要把车开走了
Emergency, I gotta take the cart.

68
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:34,080
-什么 -俱乐部会所离这里45米呢
- What?! - ?The clubhouse is 50 yards away.

69
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,960
先走23米 然后扎营休息
Walk the first 25, make camp,

70
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,260
明天早上再走完剩下的
and then tackle the rest in the morning.

71
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,140
别管乔了 我让米奇和小卡去带他
Forget about Joe, I'll have Mitch and Cam bring him.

72
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:42,360
菲尔 多疼啊 打分1到...
Phil, how's the pain? On a scale of one to --

73
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,521
宝·德里克[曾主演电影《10》]
Bo Derek!

74
00:02:43,521 --> 00:02:44,790
10 我知道了
10. Got it.

75
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:47,100
那分数倒是一点都没错啊
Boy, they did not get that score wrong, huh?

76
00:02:49,189 --> 00:02:50,300
很好
Good.

77
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:52,200
好吧 是很好 但好到让人惊艳吗
Okay, it's good, but is it wow?

78
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:54,078
我们只是要请八个人来吃早午餐
We're inviting eight people over for brunch

79
00:02:54,078 --> 00:02:57,087
邀请信上写了"朋友 罗马人 饥饿的人"
with an invitation that reads, "Friends, Romans, Hungreymen" --

80
00:02:57,087 --> 00:02:58,665
他们会被惊艳到的
they're gonna say wow.

81
00:02:59,460 --> 00:02:59,900
歌洛莉亚
Hey, Gloria.

82
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:02,020
我在送菲尔去医院
I am taking Phil to the hospital!

83
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,320
什么 他们在送菲尔去医院
What? They're taking Phil to the hospital.

84
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,980
只是胃不舒服
It's just a stomach issue.

85
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:09,320
麻烦你们去足球队接乔 然后到那边找我们
Please pick up Joe at soccer and meet us over there.

86
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,900
当然 那莉莉怎么办
Of course. Oh, but what about Lily?

87
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,457
那是什么 竖琴声吗
What is that? A harp?

88
00:03:14,457 --> 00:03:16,760
不 天啊 不
No! Dios mío, no!

89
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:18,280
天使要下凡了
The angels are coming down.

90
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,780
你们还不能带走他
You cannot have him yet!

91
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:22,980
你好
Hello?

92
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:25,760
海莉 你能去城市孩童体育馆接一下莉莉吗
Haley, would you mind picking up Lily from City Kidz gym?

93
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,500
我没车
I don't have a car.

94
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,440
艾丽克斯说她在约会 但是她可以去接莉莉
Alex said she's on a date, but she can grab Lily.

95
00:03:29,980 --> 00:03:31,820
糟糕 我们没时间等人去取车了
Oh, crap. We don't have time for this valet stuff.

96
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:32,660
我不管了
I'm going rogue.

97
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,180
卢克 这玩意儿太慢了
Luke, this thing's not fast enough.

98
00:03:34,180 --> 00:03:36,110
抓一支9号铁杆 看能不能勾到别人保险杠上
Grab a nine-iron, try to hook a bumper.

99
00:03:37,532 --> 00:03:39,432
米奇尔舅舅 我现在有点忙
Hey, Uncle Mitchell, I'm kinda busy right now.

100
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,740
是吗 我马上过去
He is? I'm on my way.

101
00:03:42,852 --> 00:03:45,256
抱歉 孩子们 今天不能多待了
Sorry, boys, gotta cut it short today.

102
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,960
快点快点 快带他进去
Hurry, hurry! Take him!

103
00:03:52,341 --> 00:03:55,448
如果菲尔死了 克莱尔会再找一个老公吗
If Phil dies, would Claire get a new husband?

104
00:03:55,448 --> 00:03:56,680
他不会死的 小家伙
Okay, he's not gonna die, bud.

105
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,320
但回答你的问题 是的 应该会
But to answer your question, yes, probably.

106
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,460
生活还得继续
You have to move on with life.

107
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,580
等等我们
Wait for us.

108
00:04:01,651 --> 00:04:03,672
快让开 快让开
Comin' in hot! Comin' in hot!

109
00:04:06,034 --> 00:04:07,153
你们就停在这里吗
You're just gonna park that right there?

110
00:04:07,153 --> 00:04:08,800
我给这里的外科主任做过衣柜
I did the closets for head of surgery here.

111
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,500
没人敢动我
I'm untouchable.

112
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,581
菲尔 亲爱的 你还好吗
Phil, honey, how are you?

113
00:04:11,581 --> 00:04:13,452
又回医院了
Oh, back in the hospital. ?Oh.

114
00:04:13,481 --> 00:04:16,785
但好多了 因为有艾尔希和她的朋友"静滴"
But better because of Elsie and her friend IV.

115
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:20,160
如果可以的话 我想请"静滴"来我们家住
If it's okay, I invited IV to come live with us.

116
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:22,260
我给你带了点东西
Well, I brought you something

117
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:25,633
会让你感觉好很多
that's gonna make you feel so much better.

118
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,260
手术熊
Oh, Surgery Bear.

119
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:30,117
我们约会的第一年 一起去了一个园游会
Our first year dating, we went to a carnival.

120
00:04:30,117 --> 00:04:31,660
在玩投掷牛奶罐的游戏时
At the milk-can toss,

121
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,580
有一只克莱尔非常喜欢的熊
there was a bear that Claire really liked.

122
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:37,180
我花了一晚上想要赢下来 但就是不行
I spent all night trying to win it, but I just couldn't.

123
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:39,860
隔天晚上又去时 园游会去下个城市了
Came back the next night and the carnival had left town.

124
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,380
所以我开车去到夫勒斯诺市 又失败了
So, I drove to Fresno, failed again.

125
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,800
萨克拉门托 还是不行
Sacramento, no dice.

126
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:47,480
六周后 在内华达卡森城 总算赢下来了
Six weeks later, in Carson City, Nevada, it happened.

127
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:47,940
是啊
Yeah.

128
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:50,460
我给她的时候 看到了她脸上的笑容
When I handed it to her and saw the smile on her face,

129
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:52,020
我当即向她求婚
I proposed to her on the spot.

130
00:04:53,096 --> 00:04:55,360
总之 从那之后
Anyhoo, it's come with me

131
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,720
我每次住院这只熊都会陪伴我 来祈求好运
to every visit in the hospital since for good luck.

132
00:04:57,780 --> 00:05:00,380
我好担心我给忘了
And I was so worried about forgetting it

133
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:01,240
所以你猜我做了什么
that guess what I did?

134
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,200
你带上了吗
Remembered it?

135
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:05,260
我给你带了非常舒服的护颈枕
Well, I brought you your nice, comfy neck pillow,

136
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:07,700
然后我马上回家给你拿手术熊好吗
and I'm gonna run right home and get you Surgery Bear, okay?

137
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:08,619
-好的 -好
- Okay. ?- Okay.

138
00:05:08,619 --> 00:05:10,680
-老爸 -对了 亲爱的
- Dad! ?- Hi. Oh, honey.

139
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,960
-怎么了 -为防有三长两短
- Yeah? ?- Just in case,

140
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:14,440
我给你和孩子们做了一支告别视频
I made one of my goodbye videos for you and the kids.

141
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:16,560
我发在老地方了
I posted it in the usual spot.

142
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,500
-好了 -告别视频
- Okay. ?- Goodbye videos?

143
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,760
没什么 别担心
It's nothing, don't worry about it.

144
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:21,300
我马上就回来
I'll be right back. I'll be right back.

145
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:22,440
-好啊 菲尔 -嗨
- Hey, Phil. ?- Hi.

146
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,160
你感觉怎么样
How you feeling?

147
00:05:23,285 --> 00:05:26,300
你跟他们说长裤的事了吗
Did you tell them about the long pants?

148
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:28,850
对 他们得把我的长裤剪掉
Oh, yeah, they had to cut me out of them

149
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:30,860
因为裤子缠上了
when th-- when they got tangled up

150
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:32,250
轮椅的辐条
in the spokes of the wheelchair!

151
00:05:32,250 --> 00:05:34,340
医院给了他上好的麻醉药啊
Well, they gave him the good stuff.

152
00:05:34,340 --> 00:05:35,920
很高兴你们赶上了祝他好运
Well, glad you got to wish him well.

153
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,878
我们得让他准备接受胆囊手术了
We have to get this guy prepped for his gallbladder surgery.

154
00:05:37,878 --> 00:05:40,660
意思是要给我刮毛了
That means they're gonna shave me.

155
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:42,620
我们要担心这句话是他的最后遗言吗
Should we be worried that those could be his last words?

156
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:43,940
我来处理 菲尔 我们爱你
I got this. Phil, we love you.

157
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:45,240
我也爱你
I love you, too.

158
00:05:45,691 --> 00:05:47,940
他们要给我刮毛了
They're gonna shave me.

159
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:48,370
我们尽力了
Well, we tried.

160
00:05:50,719 --> 00:05:53,134
你确定菲尔会没事吗
So you're sure Phil's gonna be okay?

161
00:05:53,134 --> 00:05:56,660
肯定没事 宝贝 离菲尔去世还早着呢
Absolutely, Pappy. Phil is not gonna die in a long, long time.

162
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:57,820
我会死吗
Am I going to die?

163
00:05:57,865 --> 00:06:00,077
乔 这是件自然的事
Well, Joe, it's a natural thing that we --

164
00:06:00,077 --> 00:06:00,960
停停停
Bup, bup, bup.

165
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:03,740
你似乎不会温和处理这个话题
This is not a topic you tend to handle gently.

166
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:05,180
也不怪你
It's not your fault,

167
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:08,320
你生活中的许多人都不得善终
but many people in your orbit met with ugly ends.

168
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:09,100
我来处理吧
I'll handle this.

169
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:11,760
好吧 我得去拿派对蛋糕
Fine. I have to pick up the party cake.

170
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,720
一个足球形状的球
It's shaped like a soccer ball.

171
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,098
你确定那不会吓到他们吗
You sure that won't scare them?

172
00:06:15,098 --> 00:06:16,280
因为我只见过他们
'Cause the only thing I've seen them do

173
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:18,120
飞奔躲开足球
with a soccer ball is run from it.

174
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:21,680
听着 孩子 这是个深奥的问题
Look, kid, that's a deep question,

175
00:06:21,881 --> 00:06:23,534
"我有天会死吗"
"Will I die some day?"

176
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:27,000
我要直接告诉你答案 不会
And I'm gonna be straight with you about it -- no.

177
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:28,680
永远不会吗
Never?

178
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:32,080
过去 人们大概只能活到12岁
A few years back, people would live to be around 12.

179
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,060
现在 依靠科技的力量
Nowadays, what with all the science they're doing,

180
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,960
寿命无极限
sky's the limit.

181
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:39,820
你应对得当 有天你就会活到200岁
You play your cards right, and someday you'll be 200,

182
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,820
如果你从你老爸这里学到了东西
and if you learn anything from your old man,

183
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:46,460
你会挽着一个100岁的美女新娘
you'll have a gorgeous 100-year-old bride on your arm.

184
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:51,629
女人到了180多岁 会开始爱发牢骚
Uh, there will be some squawking from women in their 180s,

185
00:06:51,629 --> 00:06:54,560
但你是个成功人士
but, uh, you're a successful man

186
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,680
你的努力换得了幸福
and you've earned your happiness.

187
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,500
胆囊到底是什么
What is a gallbladder?

188
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,460
是啊 这些你都不需要的器官是怎么回事
Yeah, and what's up with these organs you don't even need?

189
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,260
你可以切掉胆囊 阑尾
You can lose a gallbladder, an appendix,

190
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,180
啥事都没有
and everything's fine.

191
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:05,580
是啊 就像是丈夫
Yeah, kind of like husbands.

192
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,540
失去一个 就再找一个
You lose one, you just get another.

193
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:09,137
你早些时候是这样说的
That is what you said earlier.

194
00:07:09,137 --> 00:07:11,760
我怎么会料到我会引火上身的呢
Oh, how did I know that was gonna boomerang back on me?

195
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,340
我提起这事不是为了攻击你
I didn't bring it up to attack you.

196
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:14,480
我只是想知道
I just wondered...

197
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:17,100
如果我提前归西 你想过
have you ever thought about who you'd end up with

198
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:19,900
你要跟谁在一起吗
if, you know, my show closes early?

199
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:21,400
我宁愿放弃我的右"胆"囊
I would give my right gallbladder

200
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,720
都不要回答这问题
not to answer this question.

201
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:23,900
拜托 这是个有趣的游戏
Come on, it'll be a fun game.

202
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:25,440
你不想知道我心里想的是谁吗
Don't you want to know who I'm thinking about?

203
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:26,320
有点想
I guess.

204
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:29,140
好吧 那就数到三一起说名字
Okay, well, then, let's just say a name on three.

205
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,700
-小卡 -拜托
- Cam. - No, come on.

206
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,220
我觉得我的选择会让你惊讶
I think you'll be surprised by my choice.

207
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:32,860
准备好了吗
You ready?

208
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:36,739
一二三
One, two, three...

209
00:07:36,739 --> 00:07:38,380
-凯莱布 -你是我的一切
- Caleb. - You're my everything.

210
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:40,458
-你诈我 -凯莱布是谁
- Y-You -- You tricked me. - Okay, who's Caleb?

211
00:07:40,458 --> 00:07:42,878
你见过他 在乔撒姆的派对上
You -- You met him. At -- At Jotham's party.

212
00:07:42,878 --> 00:07:44,280
那个按摩师
The -- The massage therapist.

213
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:46,035
看来他按摩按到了你心坎儿里
Well, I guess he rubbed you the right way.

214
00:07:46,035 --> 00:07:46,740
小卡 拜托
Cam, oh, come on.

215
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:48,740
我说了名字只是因为你逼我说
I only said a name because you pressured me to.

216
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,800
我就跟他聊过两次天
I've had like two conversations with him.

217
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,340
我选他只是因为他让我想到了你
Look, I-I only picked him because he reminds me of you.

218
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:56,838
贴心 坦率 跟我很互补
So sweet and open and such a good balance for me.

219
00:07:56,838 --> 00:07:58,340
我觉得他可能也是
I-I thought he might be, too.

220
00:07:58,340 --> 00:07:59,940
真有爱
Well, then, that's lovely.

221
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,120
谢天谢地 我剪了正确的线[炸弹]
Oh, thank God. I cut the right wire.

222
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,240
胆囊是什么
Okay, what is a gallbladder?

223
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,160
胆囊是
The gallbladder is

224
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:08,864
"储存胆汁的4英寸梨形器官"
"A 4-inch pear-shaped organ that stores bile."

225
00:08:08,864 --> 00:08:10,931
像是胆汁橱柜
Like -- Like a little bile cabinet.

226
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:14,020
这就是为什么大家喜欢有我们陪伴
That's why people want us around.

227
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,720
凯莱布
Uh, Caleb.

228
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,180
米奇尔
Hey, Mitchell.

229
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:20,440
谢谢你这么快就赶来了
Thanks for coming on such short notice.

230
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:22,920
你可以在电视那边支按摩床
You can set your table up, uh, down in the TV area.

231
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:24,240
好 没问题
Sounds good. ?You got it.

232
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,695
怎么回事
What's going on?

233
00:08:25,695 --> 00:08:27,660
你能别这么疑神疑鬼吗
Uh, would you stop being so suspicious?

234
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:30,600
你说拍照摆姿势把你的脖子弄疼了
You said you neck hurt from posing for our photograph...

235
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,240
于是我邀请了凯莱布过来做他的工作
...so I invited Caleb over to ply his trade.

236
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,660
我觉得他不是来工作的
I do not think he's here to ply.

237
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,180
而是方便你"窥探工作"的
I think he's here so you can pry.

238
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:38,020
爸爸会没事的
Dad's gonna be fine.

239
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,940
既然聊到这事 在我的葬礼上
Since we're on the subject, at my funeral,

240
00:08:39,940 --> 00:08:41,520
记得让抬棺人说这些话
make sure the pallbearers say things like,

241
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:43,140
"她真轻"
"Wow, she's so light,"

242
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,240
"她是不是没被装在棺材里啊"
and things like, "Is she even in here?"

243
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,601
我不想被埋葬 我要为科学捐献身躯
I don't want to be buried. I'm donating my body to science.

244
00:08:47,601 --> 00:08:50,152
-你已经算捐了吧 -我要在你棺材里放壶铃增重
- Haven't you already? - I'm putting kettle bells in your coffin.

245
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,080
还得确保我的尸体被捐去常春藤联盟大学
And make sure my cadaver goes to an Ivy League.

246
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:54,560
我可不想让史瓦兹摩尔学院的宿醉新生
I don't want some hungover freshman from Swarthmore

247
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,640
对我上下其手
getting his hands all over me.

248
00:08:55,853 --> 00:08:57,460
也没那么糟糕啊
Mm. It's not so bad.

249
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:58,520
我不会死的
I'm never gonna die.

250
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,560
随着科学的发展 一切都有治愈办法
Science is gonna find a cure for everything.

251
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:01,800
外公跟我说的
Grandpa told me that.

252
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:04,760
快 孩子们 听着 手术熊不在楼上
Quick, kids, hey, listen, Surgery Bear is not upstairs.

253
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:05,300
知道在哪吗
Any ideas?

254
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:06,720
对了 爸爸把手术熊给乔了
Oh, right, Dad gave it to Joe

255
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,872
那时候他切除了扁桃体
when he got his tonsils taken out.

256
00:09:07,872 --> 00:09:09,120
你可以在我翻卢克的抽屉之前
You could've told me that

257
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,220
告诉我的
before I looked through Luke's drawers.

258
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,440
-哪个抽屉 -我们回头聊这事
- Which drawer?! - We'll get into that later.

259
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:17,120
不是吧
Come on!

260
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,040
该死
Damn it.

261
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,940
亲爱的 你找到手术熊了吗
Hey, honey, did you find Surgery Bear?

262
00:09:22,580 --> 00:09:23,939
当然
Uh... yeah, sure did.

263
00:09:23,939 --> 00:09:27,776
它就在这 睁着美丽的蓝色眼睛
He's -- He's right here with his beautiful blue eyes.

264
00:09:27,776 --> 00:09:28,960
我一直以为那是淡褐色的
I always considered them hazel,

265
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,480
但它戴着墨镜 谁知道啊
but who could tell underneath those sunglasses?

266
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,860
墨镜 好吧
Sunglasses. Right.

267
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:37,120
不如你跟我说说你最喜欢
Why don't you tell me what your favorite thing is

268
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,480
手术熊的哪点吧
about Surgery Bear?

269
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:41,520
你知道 他正好跟我是北极...
Well, as you know, he's the polar...

270
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,660
与南极般的相反
...opposite of me.

271
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,820
我讨厌冲浪
I mean, I hate surfing.

272
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,920
但是消防员喜欢冲浪也合情合理
But it makes sense that a fireman would love it.

273
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:50,460
当然了
Yes, of course.

274
00:09:51,420 --> 00:09:54,120
在我心里 他在夏天会去当志愿消防员
In my mind, he's a volunteer fireman during the summer

275
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,740
因为教授的假期很长
because professors have those off.

276
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,840
教授可以...对
Professors have -- Yes.

277
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,040
得挂了 亲爱的
Oh, gotta run, honey.

278
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,780
艾尔希要再给我打一针麻醉了
Elsie's here to give me another shot for the pain.

279
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,121
别省药 艾尔希
Don't be stingy, Elsie.

280
00:10:02,121 --> 00:10:04,062
上次我等了好久才...
Last time, it took forever to fee...

281
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:09,960
谢天谢地你在
Oh, thank God you're here.

282
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,580
哪一只是手术熊啊
Which one of these is Surgery Bear?

283
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:12,540
都不是
Neither one.

284
00:10:12,580 --> 00:10:14,720
曼尼上大学时我送给了他
I gave him to Manny when he went to college.

285
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:25,040
那是克莱尔吗
Was that Claire?

286
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,200
不知道 但我们家钥匙给太多人了
I don't know, but we've given out too many keys.

287
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,320
下面的人小心
Look out below!

288
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,340
你在干什么 你会害死自己的
What are you doing there?! You're gonna kill yourself!

289
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:32,860
不 我不会的
No, I won't.

290
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,940
爸爸说我可以永生
Dad said I'm gonna live forever.

291
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:36,160
下来
Come down here.

292
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,039
你就这么告诉他的吗 你疯了吧
Is that what you told him? Are you crazy?

293
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:40,479
我不想破坏孩子的天真
I didn't want to steal the kid's innocence.

294
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:42,160
乔 我知道你爸是这么说的
Joe, I know what your father said,

295
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,220
但忘了吧
but forget it.

296
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,380
你这样是会死的
You can die from that.

297
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:46,400
真的吗
Really?

298
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:47,940
真的 人常因为各式各样的原因而死
Yes. People die all the time.

299
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:49,600
这就是为什么你得小心
That's why you have to be careful.

300
00:10:50,100 --> 00:10:51,300
每个人都会死
Everyone dies.

301
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:52,540
你可能会噎死
You can choke

302
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:55,540
或者重物会砸在你头上
or something very heavy can fall on top of your head.

303
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:58,760
有次我听说有个小孩爆炸了
One time, I heard there was a little kid that exploded.

304
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:02,480
修女说是因为他有肮脏的想法
The nuns said that it was because of unclean thoughts.

305
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:04,000
你明白了吗
Do you get all this?

306
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,400
明白 妈妈
Yes, Mommy.

307
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,300
你的朋友们来了 去欢迎人家吧
Those are your friends. Go welcome them.

308
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:09,960
乔 我带了小蛋糕
Hi, Joe. I brought cupcakes.

309
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,720
还有什么意义啊
What's the point?

310
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,180
-轻重如何 -如果你在桌子底下看
- You okay with the pressure? ?- If you looked under this table,

311
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:17,120
你会看到我像个小号手一样流口水
you'll see I'm drooling like a trumpeter.

312
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,920
抱歉
Hey, sorry to interrupt.

313
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:20,820
泡了热茶 做了手工饼干
Made some hot tea and some homemade cookies.

314
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:21,842
我突然感到
I'm suddenly feeling some

315
00:11:21,842 --> 00:11:23,247
你肩部有些紧张 米奇尔
tension in your shoulder here, Mitchell.

316
00:11:23,247 --> 00:11:24,980
你会像我一样做饭吗 凯莱布
Do you cook, like I do, Caleb, or...?

317
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:27,000
不 不如过去频繁了
Oh, no. Not as much as I used to.

318
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,711
是吗 可什么都比不上
Oh, yeah, well, nothin' says lovin'

319
00:11:29,711 --> 00:11:31,320
家常美食那么表达爱意啊
like a home-cooked meal.

320
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,160
我知道
I know.

321
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,860
我经营自己的饭店15年了
I had my own restaurant for 15 years.

322
00:11:35,060 --> 00:11:37,060
但失败了 你破产啦
Oh, but it failed and you lost everything?

323
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:38,600
不 我得从中脱身
No, I had to walk away.

324
00:11:39,190 --> 00:11:41,100
压力太大了
It's such a stressful life.

325
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:43,640
但我真的好怀念能为某人做饭
But I do miss having someone to cook for.

326
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:45,720
小卡 为啥不等凯莱布
Cam, maybe you want to get into these topics

327
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,150
给你按摩时再聊这些话题
with Caleb during your massage?

328
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:49,578
好 我不打扰你们了
Oh, yeah, okay. I'll leave you guys.

329
00:11:51,017 --> 00:11:52,680
紧绷的肌肉放松下来了
And the knots are melting away.

330
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:55,020
-我是个鼓手 -这里又好大一块紧绷了
- You know, I'm a drummer. - Big one coming back here now.

331
00:11:55,180 --> 00:11:56,500
你懂音乐不 凯莱布
Are you musical in any way, Caleb?

332
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:58,880
懂啊 实际上我曾经玩过乐队
Yeah, I was actually in a band once.

333
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:01,680
但失败了 你失去一切了
But it failed and you lost everything?

334
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,160
不 实际上我们还去欧洲巡回演出几年
Uh, no. We actually toured Europe for a couple years.

335
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:06,060
我还用那收入买了房子和夏威夷的小屋
Bought me a house and a cabin in Hawaii.

336
00:12:06,220 --> 00:12:07,020
你说夏威夷
When you say Hawaii,

337
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:08,680
你说的是夏威夷岛吗
you mean the big island of Ha-va-ee?

338
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,800
不好意思 凯莱布
I'm sorry, Caleb.

339
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,620
我刚想起来我得和卡梅隆
I just remembered I need to talk to Cameron

340
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:12,920
聊下回收垃圾箱的事儿
about the recycling bin.

341
00:12:13,700 --> 00:12:14,740
能让我们单独聊会儿吗
Would you excuse us?

342
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:15,640
当然
Sure.

343
00:12:15,757 --> 00:12:16,657
谢谢
Thanks.

344
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,260
你不要发神经
You're acting crazy.

345
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:21,040
好吧 你知道吗
Okay, you know what?

346
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:23,540
是因为我担心我有健康问题 米奇尔
I have some health issues on my mind, Mitchell,

347
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:25,440
而且我只是简单地测试一下他
and I was simply evaluating the man

348
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:28,279
他可能有天会是莉莉的继父呢
who might become Lily's stepfather someday.

349
00:12:28,279 --> 00:12:30,300
小卡 你的健康没问题
Cam, your -- your health is fine.

350
00:12:30,300 --> 00:12:32,320
这可不好说 菲尔今早起床时
You don't know that. Phil probably thought the same thing

351
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,277
可能也这么想呢
when he woke up this morning.

352
00:12:33,277 --> 00:12:34,280
疾病都是潜伏的
Okay. Things lurk.

353
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:35,600
好吧 原来是这么回事
Okay, so that's what this is?

354
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,249
你 看到菲尔那样你受刺激了
You -- Seeing Phil flipped you out,

355
00:12:37,249 --> 00:12:39,117
但没有潜伏的疾病啦
but nothing is lurking.

356
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,920
好吧 可能我是疯了
Okay. Maybe I'm being crazy.

357
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,480
我让他回去
How about if I send him home...

358
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:47,020
我亲自给你按摩 怎么样
and finish this little massage myself?

359
00:12:47,534 --> 00:12:50,080
垃圾箱一切还好吧
Hey! Uh, everything okay with the recycling bins?

360
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,836
什么 那个借口啊
What? Oh. Oh. The excuse.

361
00:12:51,836 --> 00:12:54,515
还好 听我说 其实刚才是因为
Y-Y-Yes, and listen, about earlier, um,

362
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:57,100
米奇尔有点暗恋你 所以我表现得很奇怪
Mitchell has a little crush on you and I was being weird,

363
00:12:57,100 --> 00:12:58,599
但现在没事了
but we're all good now, so...

364
00:12:58,599 --> 00:13:01,413
不 其实很高兴听到这些
No, it's actually really nice to hear.

365
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:02,520
我刚被甩
I just got dumped...

366
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:04,640
所以任何的认可我都接受
...so I'll take any validation I can get.

367
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:07,200
他说了喜欢我什么吗
Did he say what exactly about me he liked?

368
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,060
我觉得是你不粘人吧
I think how not needy you are.

369
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:11,820
总之我们太对不起你了 你该离开了
Anyway, we've put you through enough, you should go.

370
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:12,900
我会接着给他按摩
I'll finish the massage.

371
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:15,200
不用了 不 你们已经付款了
Oh, absolutely not. Please, you've already paid.

372
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,600
而且我走后就得自己待在公寓里
Besides, when I leave, I'm just gonna be alone

373
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,440
和那只我们一起领养的鹦鹉一起
in that apartment with the parrot that we adopted.

374
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,580
西尔维奥在哪 西尔维奥在哪
Where's Silvio? Where's Silvio?

375
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:24,300
我不知道 他离开了
I don't know. He left!

376
00:13:30,578 --> 00:13:32,440
我突然有种冲动
Hey, I-I just had an impulse.

377
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,580
别按摩了
Let's skip the massage.

378
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:36,280
我去拿酒 你在卧室里等我
I'll grab some wine and you can meet me in the bedroom.

379
00:13:37,060 --> 00:13:38,340
快 去啊
Go on. Get in there.

380
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:47,240
走开
Go away!

381
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:49,080
你都不知道是谁敲的门
You don't even know who it is.

382
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:50,600
是克莱尔 我需要手术熊
It's Claire. I need Surgery Bear.

383
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,078
时机不对 克莱尔
Not a good time, Claire.

384
00:13:52,078 --> 00:13:53,635
必须得拿到它 老兄
Oh, gotta have it, buddy.

385
00:13:54,180 --> 00:13:55,060
你知道在大学
You know how in college,

386
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:56,800
每个人都要经历一段反叛期吗
everybody goes through a rebellious phase --

387
00:13:56,900 --> 00:13:58,840
你还记得有次艾丽克斯把自己锁在浴室
You know how one time Alex locked herself in the bathroom

388
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,740
我把门踹开吗
and I kicked the door down?

389
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:03,720
你紧张兮兮就是为了这个吗 耳钉
That's what all the fuss is about? An earring?

390
00:14:04,438 --> 00:14:05,820
熊呢
Ugh. Where's the bear?

391
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:06,220
柜子
Closet.

392
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:09,320
耳钉只是个开始
I started with an earring.

393
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,355
根本没人注意到
No one even noticed.

394
00:14:10,355 --> 00:14:12,360
所以你可能需要升级
So, you might need to up your game, pal.

395
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,740
可以在脖子上绕个蛇
Try wearing a snake around your neck

396
00:14:13,740 --> 00:14:15,860
然后一有人谈论就表现得你很烦
and then act annoyed when people want to talk about it.

397
00:14:15,860 --> 00:14:16,740
抽屉
Drawers?

398
00:14:17,468 --> 00:14:18,917
我采取了不同的方式
I went a different way.

399
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,580
好吧
Oh! Okay.

400
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:26,540
首先 欢迎来到反叛期
Well, first of all, welcome.

401
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,040
我们这样比较有趣
We do have more fun.

402
00:14:29,460 --> 00:14:31,300
我猜你喜欢这样
I'm guessing you like it,

403
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,100
但你担心其他人的想法
but you're worried what other people will think?

404
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:35,540
路人甲把我比作网球
A passerby likened me to a tennis ball.

405
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:37,040
而你不能...
And you can't...

406
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:39,100
躲在这 等着它长长
hide in here until it grows out.

407
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,398
我算过了
I ran the numbers.

408
00:14:40,398 --> 00:14:41,980
即使是衣物都反过来穿
Even with inside-out wearings,

409
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:43,340
我也只能宅在这里三周
I'd be out of underwear in three weeks.

410
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:43,920
好吧
Yeah.

411
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:49,360
我和你讲讲我认识的最开心的家伙
Um, let me tell you about the happiest guy I know.

412
00:14:49,820 --> 00:14:52,240
他在他家前院拉了一个钢索
He stretched a tightrope across his front yard.

413
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:53,780
从不在意邻居侧目
Didn't worry about the neighbors.

414
00:14:54,075 --> 00:14:56,131
他用弹簧单高跷跳着去上班
He pogo-sticked to work, and...

415
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:01,160
关键是 他不在意别人怎么想
The point is, he doesn't care what anybody thinks,

416
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:02,160
如果他在意
and if he did,

417
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,060
他就得不到那么多的乐趣
he wouldn't have had half the fun he's had.

418
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:07,080
我再问你
Let me ask you again.

419
00:15:08,500 --> 00:15:09,420
你感觉这头发怎么样
How do you feel about the hair?

420
00:15:10,021 --> 00:15:11,988
还挺喜欢的
Kinda like it. Yeah.

421
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,300
对于杰会讨厌这头发 你有何想法
How do you feel about the fact that Jay's gonna hate it?

422
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,180
我喜欢
I love that.

423
00:15:18,940 --> 00:15:19,660
谢谢了 克莱尔
Thanks, Claire.

424
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:22,020
我得再抱一会儿
Yeah, I'm gonna hold on just a little longer.

425
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,100
我今天超需要拥抱
I need it today. Okay.

426
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:26,800
橱柜
Oh. Cabinet.

427
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:30,860
不是吧
Come on.

428
00:15:35,020 --> 00:15:36,440
抱歉打扰一下
I hate to interrupt,

429
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,400
你就大声嚷说会打回给她吧
but if you just scream you'll call her back,

430
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,460
我觉得你会想先去看乔的派对怎么了
you might want to see how Joe's party's going.

431
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,920
很明显 乔和他的朋友们分享了
Apparently, Joe shared the uplifting news

432
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:48,120
大家可能随时死掉的振奋人心消息
that his friends could die at any minute.

433
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,680
我喜欢我的工作
Hey, so, I love what I do,

434
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:56,600
但我以观众的活力为生
but I feed off the energy of my audience.

435
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:58,000
如果观众没什么热情
And if I'm not getting a lot back,

436
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,420
我就更难忘记我已经45岁
it's harder for me to forget I'm a 45-year-old

437
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:02,160
科班出身却穿着连裤袜
classically trained actor in a body sock

438
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:04,537
披风除了当道具 还得当作车厢窗帘用
and a cape that doubles as a curtain in my van.

439
00:16:04,537 --> 00:16:05,916
所以我先走了
So, I'm gonna go.

440
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,580
杰克逊 妈妈来了
Jackson, Mama's here!

441
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,760
你居然对他们说他们都会死
You told them they were all going to die?

442
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:13,940
不 我只对乔说了 但说的方式很温和
No, only Joe, but in a very nice way.

443
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:15,719
真的吗 那他们怎么看起来像
Really? Because it looks like the "before" picture

444
00:16:15,719 --> 00:16:17,300
嚼服百忧解之前的对比照片
in an ad for chewable Prozac.

445
00:16:17,300 --> 00:16:18,320
把我们也带走
Take us, too!

446
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,940
乔 过来
Joe, come here.

447
00:16:21,380 --> 00:16:24,100
这件事我们得再谈一次
We need to talk again about the thing.

448
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:26,300
我只想去床上躺着
I think I'm just gonna go to bed.

449
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,020
等等
Hold on.

450
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:29,100
我们都会在某天死去不假
It's true we all die sometime.

451
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:30,880
但像你年纪这么小的人
But someone like you, so young,

452
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,040
会活很久很久的
is gonna live a long, long, long time.

453
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:34,200
是的 重点是
Yeah, and the thing is,

454
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:36,520
知道我们会在某天死去是件好事
knowing we're gonna die some day can be a good thing.

455
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:38,880
因为这能提醒我们
Because it reminds us to appreciate

456
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:41,560
珍惜我们活着时的每分每秒
every minute that we're around.

457
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:43,300
这让你很受打击 对吗
It's hitting you hard, isn't it?

458
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:46,140
我感觉我再也不会笑了
It feels like I'm never going to laugh again.

459
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,340
但这是很自然的
But that's natural.

460
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:50,320
你面对的是个很成人化的问题
This is a pretty adult thing you're dealing with here.

461
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:52,722
事实上 如果你接下来几天
In fact, I'd be worried about you if you weren't

462
00:16:52,722 --> 00:16:54,796
没有垂头丧气 我反而会担心
walking underneath a cloud for a few days.

463
00:16:55,060 --> 00:16:55,880
但最终...
And eventually --

464
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:05,560
你 我 卧室
You, me, bedroom.

465
00:17:05,621 --> 00:17:08,220
我拿了红酒 我想好好红红火火浪一浪
I got the Syrah and I want to do something Syr-wrong.

466
00:17:08,220 --> 00:17:09,860
你不按摩了吗
But what about your massage?

467
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,340
我说了不想按了
I said I didn't want it.

468
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:12,160
快来
Come on.

469
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,540
米奇尔 我们能这样我真高兴
Mitchell, I am so happy we're doing this.

470
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:18,640
我们好久没这样随性过了
We haven't done anything spontaneous in forever.

471
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,340
我希望你对我的选择满意
I hope you like what I picked out for us.

472
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:22,380
和以往比起来水果味更重些
It is a little fruitier than we're used to.

473
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,760
今天可真波折
What a day, huh?

474
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:27,160
罗马托加袍 看急诊
Togas and health scares...

475
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:28,740
米奇尔 我爱你
Mitchell, I love you,

476
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:31,100
我不想让凯莱布夹在我们中间
and I don't want Caleb to get between us.

477
00:17:31,100 --> 00:17:32,099
那你们想让我在哪个位置
Oh, so, where do you want me, then?

478
00:17:32,099 --> 00:17:34,522
我的天 你在这做什么
Wha-? Oh, my God. W-what are you doing here?

479
00:17:34,522 --> 00:17:36,240
我 卡梅隆说你喜欢我
Me? I -- Cameron said that you liked me,

480
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,460
然后你又叫我来卧室等你
and then you said meet you in the bedroom.

481
00:17:37,460 --> 00:17:38,980
你告诉凯莱布我喜欢他吗
You told Caleb that I liked him?

482
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,560
你告诉他来卧室等你吗
You told him to meet you in the bedroom?

483
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:41,760
我以为是对你说的
I thought I was talking to you.

484
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:44,000
二位 听起来我们三个都需要放纵一下
Guys, it sounds like all three of us could really use this.

485
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,120
别急 凯莱布
Take it easy, Caleb.

486
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:46,940
很快米奇尔就是你的人了
You'll have Mitchell to yourself soon enough.

487
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:49,060
小卡 你命长着呢
Cam, you're not dying!

488
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,460
这我们可不知道
We don't know that I'm not!

489
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:53,540
我有个表亲就是我这年纪死的
I-I had a cousin that died at my age

490
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:54,620
死于遗传病
from a genetic condition,

491
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:56,880
是我妈这边传下来的
and it runs on my mom's side of the family.

492
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,960
如果你有那两种基因就有危险
And if you have those two genes, you're at risk.

493
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:01,560
所以我今天才神经兮兮的
That's why I've been acting crazy all day.

494
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,000
那就去做个检测
Well, then, take a test

495
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,000
确保你没有那对老妈基因[牛仔裤]
to make sure you don't have that pair of mom genes.

496
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:07,500
米奇尔 我的确去做了检测
Mitchell, I did take the test.

497
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,000
一周前做的
I took it a week ago,

498
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,118
我太害怕了一直不敢看结果
and I've been too scared to look at the results.

499
00:18:11,118 --> 00:18:13,620
亲爱的 我真抱歉
Oh, honey, I'm-I'm so sorry

500
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:14,840
你一直都在独自承受这些
you've been going through this by yourself.

501
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,420
我们一起看结果 好不好
Let's look at the results together, okay?

502
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,300
-真的吗 -当然
- Really? - Yeah.

503
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:22,140
好 我要看了
Okay, here goes.

504
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,240
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

505
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:24,754
你没事
You're okay?

506
00:18:24,754 --> 00:18:26,300
不 是网购订单发货了
No, my Etsy order shipped.

507
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,800
但 好吧 这就是结果
But, okay, here's the -- here it is.

508
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:30,160
-你来看 我不敢看 -好好好
- You look. I cannot look at it. - Okay, okay, okay.

509
00:18:30,384 --> 00:18:31,240
是阴性的
It's-it's negative.

510
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,500
-什么 -你没事 快看
- What? - You're fine. Look.

511
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,498
-真的吗 -真的
- Is it? ?- Yeah.

512
00:18:33,498 --> 00:18:35,503
我的天 我真不敢相信
Oh, my God! I can't believe it!

513
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:38,079
这可得好好庆祝一下
Oh, now, that is something to celebrate.

514
00:18:38,079 --> 00:18:40,068
-是啊 我爱你 -我爱你
- Yeah. I love you. - I love you.

515
00:18:40,068 --> 00:18:42,129
好了 伙计们 我不傻
All right, guys, I'm not-I'm not dense here.

516
00:18:42,129 --> 00:18:44,843
我知道我该走人了
I-I know this is my cue to leave.

517
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:49,020
但你们俩的感情
But what you guys have is...

518
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:49,540
不是人人都有的
it's very special.

519
00:18:50,924 --> 00:18:52,378
你们该好好珍惜
You should cherish that.

520
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:53,780
凯莱布
Caleb --

521
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:55,000
我当然加入
I am so back in.

522
00:18:55,220 --> 00:18:57,020
我只是想说你走时想拿点饼干请自便
I was gonna say, if you want to take the cookies when you leave...

523
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:59,640
无意冒犯 但你到底看上他什么啊
No offense, but what do you see in him?

524
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,540
不好 我上天堂了
Oh, no. I'm in heaven.

525
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,520
不 你没有 还没有 你活下来了
No. No, you're not. Not yet. You made it.

526
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:12,341
告诉你一声 手术熊一直都在
And just so you know, Surgery Bear was here

527
00:19:12,341 --> 00:19:14,160
他和医生一起为你做了手术
and scrubbed in for the whole procedure.

528
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,280
那挺危险啊
That's pretty dangerous.

529
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:17,020
他是妇女研究的博士[医生]
He's a women's studies professor.

530
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:20,400
再说 我唯一需要的只是我的颈枕
Besides, the only thing I really needed was my neck pillow.

531
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:21,280
什么
What?

532
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:23,640
我知道如果不给你找点事让你忙着
I knew if you didn't have something to keep you busy,

533
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,608
你会担心一整天
you'd worry all day.

534
00:19:24,608 --> 00:19:26,285
亲爱的
Aww, honey.

535
00:19:26,420 --> 00:19:28,240
你真了解我
You really do know me.

536
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,620
我真高兴你及时醒过来了
I'm glad you woke up when you did.

537
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:34,440
你差点错过了一月的第二个周六
You almost slept through the second Saturday in January.

538
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:37,060
你为什么会这么说这日子
Why would you put it like that?

539
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:38,900
都听好 都听好
Hear ye, hear ye!

540
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:42,700
我在此宣布第一届年度邓菲运动会开幕
I hereby declare the opening of the first annual Dunphy Games --

541
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:44,500
医院特辑
hospital edition.

542
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:47,120
力量的考验
Tests of strength...

543
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:49,000
运气...
chance...

544
00:19:49,780 --> 00:19:52,040
-及心计 -赞
- ...and cunning. - Yes!

545
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:03,020
冠军将赢得令人垂涎的邓菲圣杯
With the winner receiving the coveted Dunphy chalice.

546
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:04,880
向我们的冠军米奇尔致敬
To our champion, Mitchell!

547
00:20:06,732 --> 00:20:07,736
太棒了
Yes!

548
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:09,340
熄灭火炬
Extinguish the torch.

549
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:13,108
第一届邓菲运动会就此落幕
And that concludes the first Dunphy Games.

550
00:20:13,108 --> 00:20:15,440
是冬季邓菲赛
Wi-wi-winter Dunphy Games.

551
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:18,400
我们七月九日夏季...
We'll see you all again July 9 for the Summer --

552
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:19,380
见好就收吧 菲尔
Take the win, Phil.

553
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:21,279
-好吧 -好了好了
- Okay. - Okay. All right.

554
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,220
我们发现老爸这些年来
So we discovered our dad made

555
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:25,960
拍了一系列视频
a series of videos through the years.

556
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,558
每次他身处险境
Every time he was in danger,

557
00:20:27,558 --> 00:20:29,464
他都给我们拍条告别视频
he made a good-bye video for us.

558
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:33,320
原来他这个发型已经好久好久没变过了
It turns out he's had the same haircut for a really long time.

559
00:20:34,020 --> 00:20:34,413
孩子们
Hey, kids.

560
00:20:34,413 --> 00:20:37,160
我被困在这间移动厕所里有一阵子了
I've been traped in this portable potty for some time now.

561
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:39,336
正如你们所见我的小胡子已经弯曲了
As you can see by the curling edges of my moustache,

562
00:20:39,336 --> 00:20:42,080
这里的化学气体太强了
the-the chemical fumes are strong.

563
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:45,140
我没打算在飞机上度过千禧危机 但
I didn't plan to be on a airplane for Y2K, but...

564
00:20:45,140 --> 00:20:46,271
命运如此
Here I am.

565
00:20:46,271 --> 00:20:47,560
短暂且有爱地告个别
A quick loving good-bye

566
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:50,080
因为我被一群熊包围了
as I am surrounded by a swarm of bears.

567
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:51,680
如果我今天有什么不测
If anything happens to me today,

568
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:54,016
我相信你们三个会永远照顾好彼此的
I have faith knowing the three of you will always have each others.

569
00:20:54,016 --> 00:20:55,480
我的手指都麻了
My fingers're numb.

570
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:57,660
麻到我都抓不住手机了
To the point which it's hard to even keep a grip on the phone.

571
00:20:59,320 --> 00:20:59,720
不
No!

572
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,759
不 要开始了
Oh, no! It's happening!

573
00:21:02,759 --> 00:21:05,692
要...原来是他们开始放电影了
It's ha- Oh. Ther're-they're just starting a movie.

574
00:21:05,692 --> 00:21:07,948
是动画电影《虫虫危机》
It's-it's "A Bug's Life."

575
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:08,740
视频都挺傻的
They're goofy.

576
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:10,740
但他希望临终遗言
But it's sweet that he wanted

577
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:12,840
是说给家人的 这还挺感动的
his last words on earth be something for his family.

578
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:13,720
是啊
Yeah.

579
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,943
另外历史进程已经到了
Also, we've reached a point in world history

580
00:21:15,943 --> 00:21:18,040
自拍变得过于简单的时代了
where it's become much to easy to film youself.

581
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:18,880
没错
Totally.

582
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:21,040
等等 你在说什么
Wait, what?
